    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Rideshare Rides Historys-v2-spec",
    "description": "The Rideshare Rides History API provides access to the historical records of rides within the rideshare service. Users can retrieve detailed information about past rides including pickup and drop-off locations, time taken, and fare details. This API is essential for customers wanting to review their ride history or for developers integrating rideshare data into their applications. Common consumers include mobile app developers and fleet management software providers.",
